  "openQuestions": [
    "The precheck catch {} swallows every failure (network, 4xx, 5xx, malformed result) and proceeds to payment; the log text says the endpoint may not be deployed yet ('EP 미가용 — 머지 후 활성').",
    "postOcsv2Precheck already returns response.data.result, yet the gate reads D.data?.ok. Unless the server nests the payload as result.data = { ok, lines, errors }, ok:false is never seen and the gate never blocks. Actual server response shape is unknown.",
    "Line failure codes other than 'OUT_OF_STOCK' are all shown as '수량 불일치'; the full code list is unknown.",
    "submitOrderAndPay continues to quote/pay even when saving the draft fails (if a draft id exists) and when the pre-quote hook (medication guide upload) fails.",
    "Payment allocation (Fi) trims deposit cards from the last one and gives the remainder to the general card; behavior with multiple general cards (only the first is used) is untested on the server.",
    "Herb quantity rounds per-첩 dose to 0.1g before multiplying (3.25g x 20 = 66, not 65)."
  ]
}
